  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large cast-iron skillet over medium heat",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute",
    "Add the smoked paprika and biryani masala and cook for 1 minute",
    "Add the chopped carrots and cook until they are tender",
    "Add the red lentils, canned diced tomatoes, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer",
    "Reduce the heat to low and cook, covered, for 20 minutes",
    "Remove the skillet from the heat and let it cool slightly"
